cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite this repository and Pablo Soberón's source paper."
title: "A convex-body four-hyperplane counterexample in R^4"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Akopyan"
    given-names: "Arseniy"
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization of a convex-body strengthening/variant of Pablo Soberón's
  2026 four-hyperplane mass-partition counterexample in R^4. The obstructed mass
  is uniform Lebesgue volume on a convex body with nonempty interior.
license: Apache-2.0
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Four hyperplanes do not always equipartition a mass in R^4"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Soberón"
        given-names: "Pablo"
    year: 2026
    url: "https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.23312"
